text:
{"prompt":"A stylized anime illustration of a petite Japanese-inspired schoolgirl character with a gentle, innocent, and refined aesthetic. She has a delicate heart-shaped face, fair porcelain-like skin, and large clear pink eyes that give a soft, timid expression. Her chestnut-brown hair is styled into neatly arranged twin ponytails with straight-cut bangs, with slightly curled ends that add a lively, cute feel.

Her overall appearance blends Japanese academy fashion with a light, elegant frilly style. She wears a white short-sleeved blouse with lace-edged collar details and a neatly tied red ribbon bow at the neckline. The outfit is paired with a plaid pleated skirt in coordinated tones, white over-knee socks, and black round-toe leather shoes. The clothing features detailed textures such as lace trim, folds, and ribbons, creating a polished and aesthetically pleasing school uniform look.

The character stands in a soft, neutral pose, conveying a quiet, well-mannered, slightly shy but graceful personality. The art style is high-quality anime illustration with clean linework, soft lighting, and a pastel, airy color palette. The background is minimal and unobtrusive to emphasize the character design.","size":"1024x1024","n":1}

